WEBVTT

00:34:29.410 --> 00:34:33.418
about how capitalism needs to be reformed,

00:34:33.442 --> 00:34:36.569
focused a lot on the wealth gap,
the growing wealth gap

00:34:36.593 --> 00:34:38.799
and the problems that that's causing.

00:34:38.823 --> 00:34:40.498
So what's our opportunity here,

00:34:40.522 --> 00:34:42.315
what changes can we make?

00:34:43.998 --> 00:34:49.037
RD: Well, you know, what I was seeing was,

00:34:49.061 --> 00:34:51.646
do we want the outcomes
that we're getting,

00:34:51.670 --> 00:34:53.334
that the system is producing?

00:34:54.144 --> 00:34:56.009
Do we have --

00:34:56.033 --> 00:34:57.937
What is our American dream?

00:34:59.850 --> 00:35:01.016
What is that?